"20260702152428494796_ccadc4b9", "type": "Claim", "text": "The composite polymorphic robot route is framed in Chinese white papers as an 
important technical pathway for embodied intelligence, with composite polymorphic robot design philosophies and implementations seen as both a
natural evolution of robot technology and a market-driven choice intended to enhance performance and advantages of embodied systems.", 
"source_ids": ["20260702151855785973_336d63ca"], "citations": [8], "sources": [{"source_id": "20260702151855785973_336d63ca", "title": 
"大模型赋能的具身智能：自主决策和具身学习技术的全面最新综述-人工智能技术与咨询", "url": "https://www.longtengyatai.com/info/284", 
"source_type": "blog", "published_at": "2025-10-31T14:57:20"}]}, {"id": "20260702152428561370_171ba60c", "type": "Claim", "text": "Chinese 
policy documents and national reports between 2023 and 2025 increasingly position embodied intelligence and intelligent robots as 
