"report", "published_at": "2025-08-09"}]}, {"id": "20260702152428787533_e5df95fe", "type": "Claim", "text": "Industry analyses up to 2025 
identify persistent cross-route technical bottlenecks for commercializing general embodied intelligence, including incomplete algorithmic and 
