"20260702152819898948_7d4f3302", "type": "Claim", "text": "From 2022–2025, a distinct technical route for embodied intelligence is the \"large
model + robot\" paradigm, in which large language models handle task understanding and code generation, vision-language models provide 
semantic environment understanding, and vision-language-action (VLA) models generate end-to-end action policies.", "source_ids": 
["20260702151855672073_474a9cc4", "20260702151855707416_0f6d4507"], "citations": [5, 6], "sources": [{"source_id": 
