"published_at": "2025-08-09"}]}, {"id": "20260702152820132302_7f880879", "type": "Claim", "text": "Hierarchical control combining large 
language models (LLMs) with reinforcement learning (RL) forms another embodied intelligence route, where LLMs specify high‑level strategies 
and RL policies generate low‑level actions, often implemented as multi‑time‑scale control with slower high‑level planning and fast low‑level 
body control.", "source_ids": ["20260702151855707416_0f6d4507", "20260702151855785973_336d63ca"], "citations": [6, 8], "sources": 
