"20260702152207114798_3745c70c", "type": "Claim", "text": "High-quality, ultra-large-scale embodied datasets are identified as a foundational 
enabler for embodied foundation models, with cited ManiBox-style research indicating a power-law relationship between spatial generalization 
volume and required data, such that achieving 38× spatial generalization demands roughly 38^0.35× more data, and each tenfold increase in data
