"20260702152207206666_aa7d7528", "type": "Claim", "text": "Industry analyses of general embodied intelligence emphasize that closing the full 
‘perception–planning–control–execution’ loop and obtaining sufficient high-quality closed-loop data remain central technical bottlenecks for 
commercialization as of early 2025.", "source_ids": ["20260702151855672073_474a9cc4", "20260702151855707416_0f6d4507"], "citations": [5, 6], 
