"20260702152427814655_4a4
   1.6  20513", "type": "Claim", "text": "One mainstream technical evolution route for embodied intelligence is the fusion of generative AI 
with robot learning, progressing from traditional model‑based and learning‑based motion control toward a \"large model + robot\" paradigm 
where LLMs handle task understanding and code generation, VLMs handle environment semantics, and VLA models generate end‑to‑end action 
policies.", "source_ids": ["20260702151855672073_474a9cc4", "20260702151855707416_0f6d4507"], "citations": [5, 6], "sources": [{"source_id": 
