"https://pdf.dfcfw.com/pdf/H3_AP202508091724252221_1.pdf?1754816055000.pdf=", "source_type": "report", "published_at": "2025-08-09"}]}, {"id":
"20260702152428183867_3c1899a5", "type": "Claim", "text": "A hierarchical large-model-plus-reinforcement-learning route for embodied control 
